Hi Pieter,
Not sure if you saw this already, but we have a section <http://docs.rstudio.com/shinyapps.io/security-and-compliance.html> in the user guide that tries to answer some of the concerns you have raised.  I would appreciate it if you could give it a quick read through and let us know what questions are still unanswered so we can improve it.

Best,
Tareef

