In theory you should be able to do:

> rsconnect::setProperty('application.visibility', 'private')
Error in authInfo$secret : $ operator is invalid for atomic vectors

But apparently something isn't quite working properly. I opened an issue <https://github.com/rstudio/rsconnect/issues/137> in the rsconnect package.

On Saturday, October 22, 2016 at 9:11:40 PM UTC-4, dlau wrote:
> Is there a possibility to make the app private, without having to login to the shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> dashboard?

